Date: Wed, 10 Oct 2018 08:56:01 +0200
Subject: Re: Change help type in Eclipse Statet
In-Reply-To: <645110d3-fd87-c28d-d896-b70733ebe28e@oswaldonline.de>
References: <959210946.104269.1528890663510@correo.movistar.es> <645110d3-fd87-c28d-d896-b70733ebe28e@oswaldonline.de>
Message-ID: <6eda939b-cbe7-9d26-a027-e6d0341b588a@walware.de>

Hi Christian,

do you use R 3.5?

You can repair the help shown in StatET by running

> registerS3method("print", "help_files_with_topic", rj::print.help_files_with_topic)

at startup of the console.

Regards,
Stephan


